DreamNativeWidgetHost:ResolutionScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamNativeWidgetHost.h#DreamNativeWidgetHost:ResolutionScale
    src   "How many render-target pixels one local unit is worth. One is pixel-for-pixel.\n\nHere rather than in a style because it is not a LOOK, it is a fidelity-versus-memory decision\nabout one particular hosted widget, and a project sheet has nothing useful to say about it."
    text  "一个本地单位相当于多少个渲染目标像素。值为 1 时即逐像素对应。\n\n放在这里而不是放在样式里，是因为它不是一种外观，而是针对某个特定\n托管控件的保真度与内存之间的取舍，项目样式表对此没有有用的说法。"
    state machine
}

